                        "entry_id": "752a2f5e-7848-3cc7-b3cc-afb0955d5bec",
                        "glosses": [
                            "One who relies solely on scientific measurements and observable facts without taking human nature into consideration."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "74567722-dc95-4c10-ac45-520685235239",
                                "sense_id": "bf14a03c-fd1d-320a-a76e-7ac1d6741626",
                                "text": "They do just what all the practical men of this practical age are doing, what even the Gradgrinds are doing: they embody ideas; they put thoughts into facts."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5b7414c7-8924-401c-882b-9fed26e684ed",
                                "sense_id": "bf14a03c-fd1d-320a-a76e-7ac1d6741626",
                                "text": "“I was purring. I'm a Gradgrind—it's quite right—anything you can say about Herbert Spencer, vivisectors, materialistic Science or Atheists, applies without correction to me. […]”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c9353726-c35c-41b7-a85c-40294ce94691",
                                "sense_id": "bf14a03c-fd1d-320a-a76e-7ac1d6741626",
                                "text": "He was a veritable Gradgrind for facts, facts, facts."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
